{"problem_id":"371e1a7e-a8c1-4657-8b16-dc617e02ec7b","source_problem_id":"508961","normalized_content":{"assets":[{"alt":"","url":"/assets/9fdd1754-eb09-4d60-b6d2-21846e4ce9bb","kind":"ordinary_image","asset_id":"9fdd1754-eb09-4d60-b6d2-21846e4ce9bb","asset_key":"image_1"}],"format":"teacherhelper-normalized","sections":[{"key":"condition","html":"<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"9fdd1754-eb09-4d60-b6d2-21846e4ce9bb\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/9fdd1754-eb09-4d60-b6d2-21846e4ce9bb\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+a\"></span>. Най­ди­те, при каком зна­че­нии <i>x</i> зна­че­ние функ­ции равно 0,8.</p>","title":"Условие","asset_keys":["image_1"],"section_id":"condition:1"},{"key":"answer","html":"<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-15</span></p>","title":"Ответ","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"answer:1"},{"key":"solution","html":"<p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  1, зна­чит, <i>a</i>  =  1. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(3)  =  2, тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{k}{3}+1=2\\iff k=3\"></span>.  Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{3}{x}+1=0{,}8\\iff x=-\\frac{3}{0{,}2}=-15\"></span>. </p></center>","title":"Решение","asset_keys":[],"section_id":"solution:1"}],"schema_version":3,"problem_reference_ids":{"prototype_problem_id":null,"group_parent_problem_id":null,"adjacent_group_parent_problem_id":null}}}
